# The Theorist, Jace Beleren's -2 cannot choose a hexproof creature (CR 702.11b): Bot2 controls Sylvan Caryatid (hexproof)
# and an Ornithopter, and when Bot1's -2 asks for the target, the Caryatid is refused while the Ornithopter - the positive
# control, asked in the same question - is chosen and returns to Bot2's hand. The Caryatid stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
The Theorist, Jace Beleren
Island x4
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Emerald
Sylvan Caryatid
Ornithopter
Island x3
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
